@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5096
@apiKey = devkey
# The id from GET user/list (demo mode: the demo account).
@userId = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### Overview (range: Week, Month, Quarter, YearToDate, Year, All)
GET {{HostAddress}}/portfolio/overview?userId={{userId}}&range=Year
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Holdings
GET {{HostAddress}}/portfolio/holdings?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### One position (key: the ISIN, or T212:<ticker>)
GET {{HostAddress}}/portfolio/position?userId={{userId}}&key=IE00B4L5Y983&range=Year
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Activity (kind: Buy, Sell, Dividend, Interest, Deposit, Withdrawal, Fee)
GET {{HostAddress}}/portfolio/activity?userId={{userId}}&skip=0&take=40
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Income of a year
GET {{HostAddress}}/portfolio/income?userId={{userId}}&year=2026
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
